  "protocol": "Pump (tiptag bonding-curve tokens)",
  "name": "Pump token buyToken() lets anyone seed the DEX pair before listing and set the listing price",
  "summary": "Pump's Token blocks transfers to its PancakeSwap pair before listing unless they come from the token itself, but buyToken() takes a caller-chosen receiver and pays out with this.transfer, so a buyer can send bonding-curve tokens to the pair. On graduation the token adds its whole BNB balance to that pair with zero minimum amounts. The attacker bought dust to the pair, added 1 WBNB and minted LP at its own price, then bought the curve's remainder to trigger listing and sold its tokens for the pair's BNB, across four tokens in one transaction.",
