  "notes": [
    "Every token is a full deployment by the Pump factory 0xa77253ac with identical runtime code, so each token's creation is its reset (rule 9). A scan of all Trade events from the factory's deployment (block 46620308) to block 47400000 found eleven tokens whose buyToken receiver was their own pair: the anchor's four, three more tokens hit by the same attacker 0x5d6e908c in three follow-up transactions, and two copycats (0x9943f268, 0x0f3f11d1).",
    "Loss is the BNB the eleven token contracts held for their bonding curves and lost to the attacker-priced pairs; the attackers' own buys and liquidity are netted out within each transaction. The tokens' own liquidity allotments sent to the pairs are unpriced and valued at nothing (rule 12)."
